1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,720
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Action|id=B01_A00|beat=B01|after=0}

2
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:11,495
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B01_01|beat=B01|tone=home}
[Weihe]崖伯，借你的铃用一下。它不响，我就替它响。

3
00:00:11,495 --> 00:00:16,800
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B01_02|beat=B01|tone=home}
[Yabo]借可以，别又敲出一个坑。今天最后一趟了。

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,068
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B01_03|beat=B01|tone=home}
[Weihe]东岸还有三个人，连这篮暖芽，一趟正好。

5
00:00:21,068 --> 00:00:28,268
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Action|id=B01_A03|beat=B01|after=3}

6
00:00:28,268 --> 00:00:32,558
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B01_04|beat=B01|tone=home}
[Yabo]你每次说正好，我都得再补一块桥板。

7
00:00:32,558 --> 00:00:37,278
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B01_05|beat=B01|tone=home}
[Weihe]那叫给你的手艺留生意。红尾结还认得吧？

8
00:00:37,278 --> 00:00:43,608
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B01_06|beat=B01|tone=home}
[Yabo]认得。留着尾巴，湿了也解得开。别学那些死结。

9
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:48,578
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B01_07|beat=B01|tone=home}
[Weihe]等他们过来，我替你修铃。先欠着，别记利息。

10
00:00:48,578 --> 00:00:58,658
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Action|id=B01_A07|beat=B01|after=7}

11
00:00:58,658 --> 00:01:04,818
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B02_A00|beat=B02|after=0}

12
00:01:04,818 --> 00:01:09,328
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_01|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Mideng]风标又少了一拍。不是我漏数，灯芯也往回倒。

13
00:01:09,328 --> 00:01:14,788
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_02|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Xiaozao]第四拍之后是回风。把手离开灯罩，再听一次。

14
00:01:14,788 --> 00:01:18,578
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_03|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Mideng]我在外面听了三遍，回风比昨天早。

15
00:01:18,578 --> 00:01:19,888
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_04|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Xiaozao]早多少？

16
00:01:19,888 --> 00:01:26,488
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B02_A04|beat=B02|after=4}

17
00:01:26,488 --> 00:01:31,013
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_05|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Mideng]说不准。像一句话没说完，就有人抢着接。

18
00:01:31,013 --> 00:01:35,803
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_06|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Xiaozao]说不准的时候，不动主阀。先把最后一篮送过桥。

19
00:01:35,803 --> 00:01:39,651
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_07|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Mideng]如果一直等到说得准，桥上的人等得起吗？

20
00:01:39,651 --> 00:01:44,856
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B02_08|beat=B02|tone=home}
[Xiaozao]所以我去。你留在灯塔，把每一拍记下来。

21
00:01:44,856 --> 00:01:54,096
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B02_A08|beat=B02|after=8}

22
00:01:54,096 --> 00:01:59,136
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B03_A00|beat=B03|after=0}

23
00:01:59,136 --> 00:02:02,861
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B03_01|beat=B03|tone=danger}
[Weihe]停！别踩下一块板，抓住身边那根粗索！

24
00:02:02,861 --> 00:02:06,501
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B03_02|beat=B03|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]我托住了。松一点，不要跟它硬拽。

25
00:02:06,501 --> 00:02:10,366
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B03_03|beat=B03|tone=danger}
[Weihe]不是索轮卡住。那几只铃，明明还有风！

26
00:02:10,366 --> 00:02:15,766
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B03_A03|beat=B03|after=3}

27
00:02:15,766 --> 00:02:18,806
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B03_04|beat=B03|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]看见了。有人把铃舌绑住了。

28
00:02:18,806 --> 00:02:23,011
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B03_05|beat=B03|tone=danger}
[Weihe]那边三个人也动不了了。你先救人，我抓得住。

29
00:02:23,011 --> 00:02:24,311
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B03_06|beat=B03|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]你的手已经在抖。

30
00:02:24,311 --> 00:02:26,926
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B03_07|beat=B03|tone=danger}
[Weihe]你看我的手干什么，看他们的脚！

31
00:02:26,926 --> 00:02:34,486
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B03_A07|beat=B03|after=7}

32
00:02:34,486 --> 00:02:40,646
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B04_A00|beat=B04|after=0}

33
00:02:40,646 --> 00:02:43,521
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_01|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]退到石柱后面，我把这根切开。

34
00:02:43,521 --> 00:02:46,226
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_02|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Weihe]等等，它另一头连着——

35
00:02:46,226 --> 00:02:47,161
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_03|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]喝！

36
00:02:47,161 --> 00:02:50,401
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_04|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Weihe]桥板！你切这头，那头就会收紧！

37
00:02:50,401 --> 00:02:57,001
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B04_A04|beat=B04|after=4}

38
00:02:57,001 --> 00:02:59,716
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_05|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]别动了。我不切第二根。

39
00:02:59,716 --> 00:03:04,076
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_06|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Weihe]他们会以为你让他们认命。说大声一点！

40
00:03:04,076 --> 00:03:08,791
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_07|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]东岸的人听着，抓粗索，脚贴横梁！我在这里！

41
00:03:08,791 --> 00:03:10,726
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B04_08|beat=B04|tone=danger}
[Weihe]这句比你的招式管用。

42
00:03:10,726 --> 00:03:19,966
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B04_A08|beat=B04|after=8}

43
00:03:19,966 --> 00:03:25,006
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B05_A00|beat=B05|after=0}

44
00:03:25,006 --> 00:03:29,066
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_01|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]我说过，只要不动，就不会有人掉下去。

45
00:03:29,066 --> 00:03:32,871
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_02|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]你说给谁听的？桥上的人连声音都传不过来。

46
00:03:32,871 --> 00:03:37,711
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_03|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]那就由你告诉他们。我要风井，不要他们的命。

47
00:03:37,711 --> 00:03:40,311
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_04|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]先让人下来，再谈你要什么。

48
00:03:40,311 --> 00:03:45,711
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B05_A04|beat=B05|after=4}

49
00:03:45,711 --> 00:03:50,411
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_05|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]桥一松，你们就会把风种运走。顺序不能反。

50
00:03:50,411 --> 00:03:53,731
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_06|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]风种一走，温室和吊篮都会停。

51
00:03:53,731 --> 00:03:58,651
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_07|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]我的网可以托住它们。把主阀交给我，这里不会再出事故。

52
00:03:58,651 --> 00:04:01,991
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B05_08|beat=B05|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]连走一步都得问你，也叫托住？

53
00:04:01,991 --> 00:04:09,551
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B05_A08|beat=B05|after=8}

54
00:04:09,551 --> 00:04:13,751
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B06_A00|beat=B06|after=0}

55
00:04:13,751 --> 00:04:19,041
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_01|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]天黑前，谷底的回风会全部上来。我只能托到那时候。

56
00:04:19,041 --> 00:04:23,261
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_02|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]把三个人移到承重梁上。我可以带你去看主阀。

57
00:04:23,261 --> 00:04:24,316
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_03|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]你会拖延。

58
00:04:24,316 --> 00:04:29,766
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_04|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]你也不敢让他们落下去。落下去，你就和你说的事故一样了。

59
00:04:29,766 --> 00:04:34,266
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B06_A04|beat=B06|after=4}

60
00:04:34,266 --> 00:04:37,271
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_05|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]……只移到梁上。不许碰我的线。

61
00:04:37,271 --> 00:04:38,931
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_06|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]你真带他去？

62
00:04:38,931 --> 00:04:41,161
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_07|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]我先让他们的脚有地方站。

63
00:04:41,161 --> 00:04:46,076
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B06_08|beat=B06|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]那我去找另一条路。你要等，就别替所有人等。

64
00:04:46,076 --> 00:04:52,376
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B06_A08|beat=B06|after=8}

65
00:04:52,376 --> 00:04:55,736
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B07_A00|beat=B07|after=0}

66
00:04:55,736 --> 00:04:59,051
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_01|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Weihe]桥被一张网锁了。有没有不走主索的路？

67
00:04:59,051 --> 00:05:06,216
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_02|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Yabo]有。旧维修道。现在只剩半条，另一半在云里。

68
00:05:06,216 --> 00:05:09,386
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_03|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Weihe]半条也比站着强。工具借我。

69
00:05:09,386 --> 00:05:11,881
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_04|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Yabo]你爹当年也是这么说的。

70
00:05:11,881 --> 00:05:15,481
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B07_A04|beat=B07|after=4}

71
00:05:15,481 --> 00:05:16,806
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_05|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Weihe]他后来回来了吗？

72
00:05:16,806 --> 00:05:21,526
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_06|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Yabo]回来骂了我三天，因为我没告诉他哪根梁是空的。

73
00:05:21,526 --> 00:05:22,926
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_07|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Weihe]那你这次告诉我。

74
00:05:22,926 --> 00:05:27,696
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B07_08|beat=B07|tone=danger}
[Yabo]第三根，别踩。等我拿灯，我跟你去。

75
00:05:27,696 --> 00:05:32,736
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B07_A08|beat=B07|after=8}

76
00:05:32,736 --> 00:05:37,216
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B08_A00|beat=B08|after=0}

77
00:05:37,216 --> 00:05:40,296
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_01|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]你听见声音，才知道哪根线被碰了。

78
00:05:40,296 --> 00:05:43,096
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_02|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]你也一样。只不过你听得慢。

79
00:05:43,096 --> 00:05:45,841
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_03|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]这么多线，总有一根听不见。

80
00:05:45,841 --> 00:05:47,591
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_04|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]所以我不让多余的人走动。

81
00:05:47,591 --> 00:05:52,391
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B08_A04|beat=B08|after=4}

82
00:05:52,391 --> 00:05:54,786
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_05|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]风不会按你的命令停。

83
00:05:54,786 --> 00:05:59,031
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_06|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]我不需要风听话。我只需要你把阀打开。

84
00:05:59,031 --> 00:06:01,516
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_07|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]先把温室的供暖线放开。

85
00:06:01,516 --> 00:06:04,836
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B08_08|beat=B08|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]我只锁了风叶，没有碰你们的暖管。

86
00:06:04,836 --> 00:06:11,556
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B08_A08|beat=B08|after=8}

87
00:06:11,556 --> 00:06:15,756
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B09_A00|beat=B09|after=0}

88
00:06:15,756 --> 00:06:19,276
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_01|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Mideng]不是灯油少了。整个暖管都在往回吸。

89
00:06:19,276 --> 00:06:26,901
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_02|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Yabo]风叶停了，回流把谷底寒气吸进暖管。井底的热风还憋着。

90
00:06:26,901 --> 00:06:29,056
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_03|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Weihe]把管打开能撑多久？

91
00:06:29,056 --> 00:06:36,621
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_04|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Yabo]撑不了。这里不是出口，暖芽先冻死，后面的人也过不了冬。

92
00:06:36,621 --> 00:06:41,121
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B09_A04|beat=B09|after=4}

93
00:06:41,121 --> 00:06:43,261
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_05|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Mideng]小凿还在等第五拍。

94
00:06:43,261 --> 00:06:45,036
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_06|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Weihe]你刚才为什么不跟他说？

95
00:06:45,036 --> 00:06:47,397
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_07|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Mideng]我说了，他让我再听一次。

96
00:06:47,397 --> 00:06:52,532
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B09_08|beat=B09|tone=danger}
[Yabo]那就让他看。抱这一盆去，别抱最亮的那盆。

97
00:06:52,532 --> 00:06:58,832
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B09_A08|beat=B09|after=8}

98
00:06:58,832 --> 00:07:02,752
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B10_A00|beat=B10|after=0}

99
00:07:02,752 --> 00:07:06,722
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_01|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]它不是快死了，是正在死。你摸一下盆底。

100
00:07:06,722 --> 00:07:08,247
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_02|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]……这么冷？

101
00:07:08,247 --> 00:07:12,737
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_03|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]不可能。外围的风叶只停了三分之一。

102
00:07:12,737 --> 00:07:17,487
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_04|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]风比昨天早回来，井里现在挤着两股风。

103
00:07:17,487 --> 00:07:21,687
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B10_A04|beat=B10|after=4}

104
00:07:21,687 --> 00:07:23,497
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_05|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]你刚才说少了一拍。

105
00:07:23,497 --> 00:07:27,792
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_06|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]是。你让我再听的时候，它又少了半拍。

106
00:07:27,792 --> 00:07:31,912
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_07|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]是我听错了。你继续报给我，这次不等刻度。

107
00:07:31,912 --> 00:07:35,782
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B10_08|beat=B10|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]少一拍，不代表可以把所有人交给你的猜测。

108
00:07:35,782 --> 00:07:41,662
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B10_A08|beat=B10|after=8}

109
00:07:41,662 --> 00:07:47,262
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B11_A00|beat=B11|after=0}

110
00:07:47,262 --> 00:07:52,567
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_01|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]我不开主阀。你先松开外圈，我们一起把倒风放出去。

111
00:07:52,567 --> 00:07:55,712
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_02|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]一起？你连自己的灯徒都不信。

112
00:07:55,712 --> 00:07:57,257
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_03|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]所以我正在改。

113
00:07:57,257 --> 00:08:00,952
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_04|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]拿三个人的命练习，你改得太晚了。

114
00:08:00,952 --> 00:08:06,952
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B11_A04|beat=B11|after=4}

115
00:08:06,952 --> 00:08:09,302
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_05|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]弥灯，退到我身后！

116
00:08:09,302 --> 00:08:10,612
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_06|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Mideng]左边还有一根！

117
00:08:10,612 --> 00:08:13,007
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_07|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]看见了——喝！

118
00:08:13,007 --> 00:08:17,437
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B11_08|beat=B11|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你每救一个位置，就会空出另一个。网不会。

119
00:08:17,437 --> 00:08:25,837
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B11_A08|beat=B11|after=8}

120
00:08:25,837 --> 00:08:29,757
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B12_A00|beat=B12|after=0}

121
00:08:29,757 --> 00:08:36,977
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_01|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]绞盘只能护住一边。给桥上用，下井的人就得自己爬。

122
00:08:36,977 --> 00:08:41,222
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_02|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]先救三个人。让他们自己走回来，少三份拖累。

123
00:08:41,222 --> 00:08:45,522
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_03|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]井底的压力再涨，桥和温室会一起翻。

124
00:08:45,522 --> 00:08:48,997
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_04|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]所以你又要选一个全都能救的办法？

125
00:08:48,997 --> 00:08:53,197
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B12_A04|beat=B12|after=4}

126
00:08:53,197 --> 00:08:55,377
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_05|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]我在找代价最小的。

127
00:08:55,377 --> 00:09:01,452
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_06|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]再拖，桥上冻僵的手就抓不住了。绞盘先给谁？

128
00:09:01,452 --> 00:09:04,982
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_07|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]我能把风报出来。你们走一步，我报一步。

129
00:09:04,982 --> 00:09:12,602
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B12_08|beat=B12|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]绞盘给苇禾。我沿石阶下井，不带牵引。崖伯，守住桥这边。

130
00:09:12,602 --> 00:09:18,482
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B12_A08|beat=B12|after=8}

131
00:09:18,482 --> 00:09:34,482
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B13_A00|beat=B13|after=0}

132
00:09:34,482 --> 00:09:38,127
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B13_01|beat=B13|tone=danger}
[Weihe]看灯，别看下面。灯往左，我们就等。

133
00:09:38,127 --> 00:09:40,852
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B13_02|beat=B13|tone=danger}
[Mideng]第一阵过了……别走，后面还有一阵！

134
00:09:40,852 --> 00:09:58,852
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B13_A02|beat=B13|after=2}

135
00:09:58,852 --> 00:10:00,807
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B13_03|beat=B13|tone=danger}
[Weihe]听见了。我没动。

136
00:10:00,807 --> 00:10:05,462
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B13_04|beat=B13|tone=danger}
[Yabo]第三根是空的，跨过去，右手别离粗索！

137
00:10:05,462 --> 00:10:27,462
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B13_A04|beat=B13|after=4}

138
00:10:27,462 --> 00:10:30,002
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B13_05|beat=B13|tone=danger}
[Weihe]我记着呢。你说了四遍了。

139
00:10:30,002 --> 00:10:32,782
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B13_06|beat=B13|tone=danger}
[Yabo]等你回来，我就不说。

140
00:10:32,782 --> 00:10:36,872
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B13_07|beat=B13|tone=danger}
[Weihe]那准备闭嘴吧。把篮子往我这边送一点！

141
00:10:36,872 --> 00:10:49,872
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B13_A07|beat=B13|after=7}

142
00:10:49,872 --> 00:10:55,472
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B14_A00|beat=B14|after=0}

143
00:10:55,472 --> 00:11:00,542
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_01|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]弥灯，我到第二层了。你说的回风，从井底撞上来了。

144
00:11:00,542 --> 00:11:03,712
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_02|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Mideng]我这里听见两声，间隔越来越短。

145
00:11:03,712 --> 00:11:08,402
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_03|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]报第二声。第一声是墙上的回响，别追它。

146
00:11:08,402 --> 00:11:10,687
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_04|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Mideng]那你之前数的五拍……

147
00:11:10,687 --> 00:11:16,687
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B14_A04|beat=B14|after=4}

148
00:11:16,687 --> 00:11:19,602
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_05|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]第五拍是回声。我把它当成风了。

149
00:11:19,602 --> 00:11:22,182
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_06|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]这座宫教给你的办法，也会错。

150
00:11:22,182 --> 00:11:25,342
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_07|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]会。所以我现在听人说话。

151
00:11:25,342 --> 00:11:27,917
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B14_08|beat=B14|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]人在怕的时候，错得更多。

152
00:11:27,917 --> 00:11:36,317
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B14_A08|beat=B14|after=8}

153
00:11:36,317 --> 00:11:43,317
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B15_A00|beat=B15|after=0}

154
00:11:43,317 --> 00:11:47,922
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_01|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]看清楚。没有这张网，你刚才已经被压在下面。

155
00:11:47,922 --> 00:11:50,887
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_02|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]是你锁住风叶，石头才会掉。

156
00:11:50,887 --> 00:11:52,007
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_03|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]可救你的是我。

157
00:11:52,007 --> 00:11:56,832
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_04|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]把一件事做坏，再挡住最坏的结果，不叫救。

158
00:11:56,832 --> 00:12:04,332
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B15_A04|beat=B15|after=4}

159
00:12:04,332 --> 00:12:07,492
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_05|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你还有空说这些，说明网托得很稳。

160
00:12:07,492 --> 00:12:08,911
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_06|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]哈！

161
00:12:08,911 --> 00:12:11,516
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_07|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]左手。你的左手已经慢了。

162
00:12:11,516 --> 00:12:13,426
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B15_08|beat=B15|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]那就看着我的左手！

163
00:12:13,426 --> 00:12:23,926
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B15_A08|beat=B15|after=8}

164
00:12:23,926 --> 00:12:35,126
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B16_A00|beat=B16|after=0}

165
00:12:35,126 --> 00:12:38,591
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B16_01|beat=B16|tone=danger}
[Weihe]别抓那根亮的！粗索，在你右手边！

166
00:12:38,591 --> 00:12:41,201
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B16_02|beat=B16|tone=danger}
[Mideng]灯要往右了！我把它举高，你别看错！

167
00:12:41,201 --> 00:12:46,141
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B16_03|beat=B16|tone=danger}
[Weihe]看得见。第三个人进篮了，崖伯，收！

168
00:12:46,141 --> 00:12:58,141
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B16_A03|beat=B16|after=3}

169
00:12:58,141 --> 00:13:01,586
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B16_04|beat=B16|tone=danger}
[Yabo]索轮咬住了！给我半圈，别全放！

170
00:13:01,586 --> 00:13:02,931
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B16_05|beat=B16|tone=danger}
[Weihe]我只剩一只手了！

171
00:13:02,931 --> 00:13:06,376
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B16_06|beat=B16|tone=danger}
[Yabo]那就用脚顶住，腰别直起来！

172
00:13:06,376 --> 00:13:10,531
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Act|id=B16_07|beat=B16|tone=danger}
[Weihe]你教得倒轻巧……好，顶住了！

173
00:13:10,531 --> 00:13:27,331
@WindwardBridge
{Event:Action|id=B16_A07|beat=B16|after=7}

174
00:13:27,331 --> 00:13:32,371
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B17_A00|beat=B17|after=0}

175
00:13:32,371 --> 00:13:33,476
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_01|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Mideng]你手松了！

176
00:13:33,476 --> 00:13:39,726
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_02|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Yabo]不是松，是这两根手指早就不听使唤。压这边！

177
00:13:39,726 --> 00:13:41,546
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_03|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Mideng]我压着了。现在呢？

178
00:13:41,546 --> 00:13:44,011
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_04|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Yabo]现在别说话，省点气。

179
00:13:44,011 --> 00:13:49,411
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B17_A04|beat=B17|after=4}

180
00:13:49,411 --> 00:13:55,106
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_05|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Weihe]三个人，一个不少。门后那条路去温室，扶着墙走。

181
00:13:55,106 --> 00:13:56,386
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_06|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Yabo]工具呢？

182
00:13:56,386 --> 00:13:58,111
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_07|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Weihe]掉了。人没掉。

183
00:13:58,111 --> 00:14:00,591
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B17_08|beat=B17|tone=danger}
[Yabo]……那就没丢什么要紧的。

184
00:14:00,591 --> 00:14:08,151
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B17_A08|beat=B17|after=8}

185
00:14:08,151 --> 00:14:18,791
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Action|id=B49_A00|beat=B49|after=0}

186
00:14:18,791 --> 00:14:22,916
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_01|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]三个。你也数一遍，别只顾着看那根索。

187
00:14:22,916 --> 00:14:25,111
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_02|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]三个……都在。

188
00:14:25,111 --> 00:14:30,251
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_03|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]坐这里，腿先别动。不是催你走，先把脚搁上来。

189
00:14:30,251 --> 00:14:36,581
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_04|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]我把路口封了。温室有人接，剩下的工具回来再拿。

190
00:14:36,581 --> 00:14:41,416
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_05|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]他还在抖。给他一只碗，能握住的，别太烫。

191
00:14:41,416 --> 00:14:46,581
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_06|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]当年也是三只碗。我摆在门边，摆了一整夜。

192
00:14:46,581 --> 00:14:50,516
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_07|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]今天别摆门边。拿过去，让他们自己接。

193
00:14:50,516 --> 00:14:54,661
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_08|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]手不听使唤了。老毛病，你替我——

194
00:14:54,661 --> 00:14:59,496
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_09|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]我两只手都扶着人。崖伯，慢一点，你能递到。

195
00:14:59,496 --> 00:15:05,401
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_10|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]好。拿稳，碗底厚，不烫……这只也是你的。

196
00:15:05,401 --> 00:15:08,676
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_11|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]这样就对了。你的那只呢？

197
00:15:08,676 --> 00:15:11,471
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_12|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]忘了拿。我回去取。

198
00:15:11,471 --> 00:15:15,731
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_13|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]别去了。等他们喝完，你坐下来歇一会儿。

199
00:15:15,731 --> 00:15:27,131
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Action|id=B49_A13|beat=B49|after=13}

200
00:15:27,131 --> 00:15:29,396
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_14|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]你袖口还流血。

201
00:15:29,396 --> 00:15:34,956
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_15|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]擦破了。刚才松手的时候，那个人抓得比我的结还牢。

202
00:15:34,956 --> 00:15:41,256
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_16|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]吓着了。脚已经到岸，心还留在桥上。

203
00:15:41,256 --> 00:15:45,976
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_17|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]我知道。刚才第三个人往下沉，我也没听见你喊什么。

204
00:15:45,976 --> 00:15:51,696
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_18|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]我喊的是别救篮子，先救人。你听见了吗？

205
00:15:51,696 --> 00:15:55,371
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_19|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]没听见。我只看见一只手，就伸手了。

206
00:15:55,371 --> 00:15:58,381
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_20|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]这回不骂你。暖芽呢？

207
00:15:58,381 --> 00:16:04,126
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_21|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]两匣完整，一匣碎了。别把好的藏起来，让他们看看还有。

208
00:16:04,126 --> 00:16:12,546
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_22|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]这些芽明年能分株。屋顶坏了可以补，有这个，冬天还能过。

209
00:16:12,546 --> 00:16:19,216
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_23|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]那就送去温室。别跟他们保证桥明天就好，告诉他们，我们会来接。

210
00:16:19,216 --> 00:16:22,381
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_24|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]你去哪儿？刚从桥上下来。

211
00:16:22,381 --> 00:16:27,951
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_25|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]风井。那边还有一个人，总觉得什么都得自己托着。

212
00:16:27,951 --> 00:16:32,506
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_26|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]等一下。这条布干净，先把伤口缠住。

213
00:16:32,506 --> 00:16:37,731
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Act|id=B49_27|beat=B49|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]红带留着。给我那条短的，打活结，我一会儿还得用手。

214
00:16:37,731 --> 00:16:53,691
@WindwardMarket
{Event:Action|id=B49_A27|beat=B49|after=27}

215
00:16:53,691 --> 00:17:00,411
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B18_A00|beat=B18|after=0}

216
00:17:00,411 --> 00:17:04,466
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_01|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]人已经回去了。你没有筹码了，松手！

217
00:17:04,466 --> 00:17:05,821
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_02|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]风井就是筹码。

218
00:17:05,821 --> 00:17:07,501
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_03|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]那我先让它转起来！

219
00:17:07,501 --> 00:17:08,431
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_04|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]别开那片——

220
00:17:08,431 --> 00:17:15,631
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B18_A04|beat=B18|after=4}

221
00:17:15,631 --> 00:17:16,561
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_05|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]喝！

222
00:17:16,561 --> 00:17:20,296
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_06|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Mideng]暖管亮了！等等，井里第三声是什么？

223
00:17:20,296 --> 00:17:24,316
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_07|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你开了一边，另一边的压力全落到我的线上了。

224
00:17:24,316 --> 00:17:26,396
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B18_08|beat=B18|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]你的线也不是永远不会断。

225
00:17:26,396 --> 00:17:36,476
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B18_A08|beat=B18|after=8}

226
00:17:36,476 --> 00:17:40,396
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B19_A00|beat=B19|after=0}

227
00:17:40,396 --> 00:17:42,611
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_01|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Weihe]趴下！别站在玻璃下面！

228
00:17:42,611 --> 00:17:50,096
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_02|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Yabo]那片风叶把热风放出来了，可底闸没开，它只能往暖管里挤！

229
00:17:50,096 --> 00:17:52,126
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_03|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]是我开的第一片风叶。

230
00:17:52,126 --> 00:17:54,861
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_04|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Weihe]先把这盆搬走，再说是谁开的。

231
00:17:54,861 --> 00:17:59,061
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B19_A04|beat=B19|after=4}

232
00:17:59,061 --> 00:18:03,081
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_05|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]我的盘还能引风，我把热流往门口带。

233
00:18:03,081 --> 00:18:06,961
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_06|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Mideng]门口有人！往上，破掉的那块玻璃！

234
00:18:06,961 --> 00:18:10,521
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_07|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]好，往上。你替我看着他们。

235
00:18:10,521 --> 00:18:13,876
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B19_08|beat=B19|tone=danger}
[Weihe]这次我会一直说，你别嫌烦。

236
00:18:13,876 --> 00:18:19,756
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B19_A08|beat=B19|after=8}

237
00:18:19,756 --> 00:18:24,516
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B20_A00|beat=B20|after=0}

238
00:18:24,516 --> 00:18:27,801
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_01|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]你每次说没事，都把左手藏起来。

239
00:18:27,801 --> 00:18:30,936
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_02|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]藏起来，它就不会妨碍别人。

240
00:18:30,936 --> 00:18:33,831
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_03|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]我现在替你托着，还算别人吗？

241
00:18:33,831 --> 00:18:35,196
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_04|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]……不算。

242
00:18:35,196 --> 00:18:40,296
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B20_A04|beat=B20|after=4}

243
00:18:40,296 --> 00:18:42,961
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_05|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]那告诉我，你还能撑多久。

244
00:18:42,961 --> 00:18:46,291
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_06|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]等他们走到后廊。之后我就得放。

245
00:18:46,291 --> 00:18:49,711
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_07|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]够了。我数人，你数呼吸。

246
00:18:49,711 --> 00:18:51,541
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Act|id=B20_08|beat=B20|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]这回不数风了。

247
00:18:51,541 --> 00:18:58,681
@WindwardGreenhouse
{Event:Action|id=B20_A08|beat=B20|after=8}

248
00:18:58,681 --> 00:19:02,321
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B21_A00|beat=B21|after=0}

249
00:19:02,321 --> 00:19:06,126
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_01|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Weihe]你一直不让我碰这块布，是怕我把名字擦掉？

250
00:19:06,126 --> 00:19:10,151
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_02|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Yabo]怕你问，我又想用别的话岔过去。

251
00:19:10,151 --> 00:19:13,571
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_03|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Xiaozao]那个名字，和他手甲上的一样。

252
00:19:13,571 --> 00:19:20,271
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_04|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Yabo]他以前守这座桥。那年回风早来，桥口挤满了人。

253
00:19:20,271 --> 00:19:24,171
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B21_A04|beat=B21|after=4}

254
00:19:24,171 --> 00:19:25,156
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_05|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Mideng]后来呢？

255
00:19:25,156 --> 00:19:31,626
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_06|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Yabo]他关了门，救下里面二十六个。门外还有一个，是他妹妹。

256
00:19:31,626 --> 00:19:34,491
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_07|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Weihe]没人告诉他门外还有人？

257
00:19:34,491 --> 00:19:41,621
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B21_08|beat=B21|tone=memory}
[Yabo]告诉了。他听见了。可那扇门，一开就会把里面的人拖出去。

258
00:19:41,621 --> 00:19:47,081
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B21_A08|beat=B21|after=8}

259
00:19:47,081 --> 00:19:50,441
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B22_A00|beat=B22|after=0}

260
00:19:50,441 --> 00:19:53,236
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_01|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]他现在想造一张谁也不会掉下去的网。

261
00:19:53,236 --> 00:19:57,586
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_02|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]想明白他为什么这么做，不等于让他继续绑人。

262
00:19:57,586 --> 00:20:02,636
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_03|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]也别以为说出他妹妹的名字，就能让他把手松开。

263
00:20:02,636 --> 00:20:04,636
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_04|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]我不会拿她劝他。

264
00:20:04,636 --> 00:20:08,236
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B22_A04|beat=B22|after=4}

265
00:20:08,236 --> 00:20:10,178
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_05|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Mideng]那我们怎么让他听？

266
00:20:10,178 --> 00:20:15,828
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_06|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]把他不肯看的东西，放到他眼前。和你那盆暖芽一样。

267
00:20:15,828 --> 00:20:22,203
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_07|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]主轴一停，井壁就在裂。他只看自己的线，还没看过墙。

268
00:20:22,203 --> 00:20:28,593
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B22_08|beat=B22|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]下面有旧检修窗。你们把窗打开，我把他引过去。

269
00:20:28,593 --> 00:20:33,633
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B22_A08|beat=B22|after=8}

270
00:20:33,633 --> 00:20:38,673
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B23_A00|beat=B23|after=0}

271
00:20:38,673 --> 00:20:42,668
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_01|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Yabo]这东西我留着，不是等你回来认罪。

272
00:20:42,668 --> 00:20:46,248
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_02|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Jianwang]那你留错了。桥已经换过三次索。

273
00:20:46,248 --> 00:20:51,988
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_03|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Yabo]梁还是旧的，人也是旧的。我也没改多少。

274
00:20:51,988 --> 00:20:53,208
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_04|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Jianwang]你们改得太慢。

275
00:20:53,208 --> 00:20:58,608
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B23_A04|beat=B23|after=4}

276
00:20:58,608 --> 00:21:03,983
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_05|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Yabo]是。可你把所有东西停住，它们就不会坏了吗？

277
00:21:03,983 --> 00:21:06,558
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_06|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Jianwang]至少我知道哪一根线会断。

278
00:21:06,558 --> 00:21:09,188
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_07|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Yabo]你知道墙会在哪儿裂吗？

279
00:21:09,188 --> 00:21:10,708
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_08|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Jianwang]……你想把我引开。

280
00:21:10,708 --> 00:21:15,158
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B23_09|beat=B23|tone=memory}
[Yabo]我想让你低头看一眼。两件事不冲突。

281
00:21:15,158 --> 00:21:22,718
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B23_A09|beat=B23|after=9}

282
00:21:22,718 --> 00:21:28,878
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B24_A00|beat=B24|after=0}

283
00:21:28,878 --> 00:21:34,423
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_01|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Weihe]一、二——拉！别只用手，靠过来！

284
00:21:34,423 --> 00:21:37,883
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_02|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]开了。弥灯，灯往下照！

285
00:21:37,883 --> 00:21:40,648
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_03|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Mideng]那道裂缝，一直通到最下面！

286
00:21:40,648 --> 00:21:45,878
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_04|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Yabo]看见了吗？你的线没断，整面墙要掉了。

287
00:21:45,878 --> 00:21:52,478
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B24_A04|beat=B24|after=4}

288
00:21:52,478 --> 00:21:53,508
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_05|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]都离开窗边！

289
00:21:53,508 --> 00:21:56,463
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_06|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]别一次全收！下面那片会砸下来！

290
00:21:56,463 --> 00:21:57,213
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_07|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]我知道！

291
00:21:57,213 --> 00:21:59,848
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B24_08|beat=B24|tone=danger}
[Weihe]你们谁知道都行，先把我们拉上去！

292
00:21:59,848 --> 00:22:09,088
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B24_A08|beat=B24|after=8}

293
00:22:09,088 --> 00:22:16,368
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B25_A00|beat=B25|after=0}

294
00:22:16,368 --> 00:22:19,168
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_01|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]看我！别看你的盘，先抓我！

295
00:22:19,168 --> 00:22:20,643
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_02|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]你站的那块也松了！

296
00:22:20,643 --> 00:22:23,288
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_03|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]所以快一点，我不想陪你一起掉！

297
00:22:23,288 --> 00:22:26,513
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_04|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Jianwang]抓我的线。它比布结实。

298
00:22:26,513 --> 00:22:34,313
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B25_A04|beat=B25|after=4}

299
00:22:34,313 --> 00:22:37,528
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_05|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]你的手只能顾一边。托住那片风叶！

300
00:22:37,528 --> 00:22:38,948
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_06|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Jianwang]你凭什么替我选？

301
00:22:38,948 --> 00:22:40,633
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_07|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]因为她已经接住我了。

302
00:22:40,633 --> 00:22:44,633
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B25_08|beat=B25|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]少说两句，真的很重——上来！

303
00:22:44,633 --> 00:22:55,553
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B25_A08|beat=B25|after=8}

304
00:22:55,553 --> 00:23:03,673
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B26_A00|beat=B26|after=0}

305
00:23:03,673 --> 00:23:11,608
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_01|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]井底还有泄风口，旧桥靠它过冬。先开它，再松主轴。

306
00:23:11,608 --> 00:23:13,353
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_02|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]为什么平时封着？

307
00:23:13,353 --> 00:23:21,003
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_03|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]开了，整座桥要重新找平。过去嫌麻烦，现在没得嫌。

308
00:23:21,003 --> 00:23:28,443
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_04|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]一边顶闸齿，一边压杠杆，还得锁住止回销。错一步，人就会被卷进去。

309
00:23:28,443 --> 00:23:37,143
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B26_A04|beat=B26|after=4}

310
00:23:37,143 --> 00:23:39,709
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_05|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]我能听见先到哪一边。

311
00:23:39,709 --> 00:23:41,554
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_06|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]你刚才还分不清回声。

312
00:23:41,554 --> 00:23:44,169
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_07|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]现在分得清了。因为刚才错过。

313
00:23:44,169 --> 00:23:48,174
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B26_08|beat=B26|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]够了。你有更好的办法，就现在做给我们看。

314
00:23:48,174 --> 00:24:00,354
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B26_A08|beat=B26|after=8}

315
00:24:00,354 --> 00:24:08,194
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B50_A00|beat=B50|after=0}

316
00:24:08,194 --> 00:24:13,224
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_01|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]先别站上去。把工具箱放到边上，我们只试一条缝。

317
00:24:13,224 --> 00:24:19,609
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_02|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]这箱子比我还老。你给我留个底，别散进井里。

318
00:24:19,609 --> 00:24:24,989
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_03|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]箱底在这儿，我踩着。弥灯，扶墙，脚不要踩缝。

319
00:24:24,989 --> 00:24:28,994
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_04|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]灯往上了……等一下，又倒向你们那边。

320
00:24:28,994 --> 00:24:31,639
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_05|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]压回去！先让人站稳！

321
00:24:31,639 --> 00:24:35,604
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_06|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]我扶住她了。别把你的手伸到门齿下面！

322
00:24:35,604 --> 00:24:40,964
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_07|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]看箱子。不是风把它吹走，是台子歪了。

323
00:24:40,964 --> 00:24:44,149
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_08|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]刚才只看见门开，没看脚下。

324
00:24:44,149 --> 00:24:47,609
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_09|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]你现在明白，为什么我不能把线全松了。

325
00:24:47,609 --> 00:24:54,424
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_10|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]明白。先接救索，再开门。止回销锁住，下面的人就撤。

326
00:24:54,424 --> 00:24:58,059
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_11|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]石梁只够一个人站。下面的人怎么上来？

327
00:24:58,059 --> 00:25:06,459
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B50_A11|beat=B50|after=11}

328
00:25:06,459 --> 00:25:12,469
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_12|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]轮流拉。先拉手使不上劲的，能动的留在下面帮。

329
00:25:12,469 --> 00:25:14,184
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_13|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]你把自己算在哪一边？

330
00:25:14,184 --> 00:25:20,804
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_14|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]看当时谁还能动。现在分好，摔一下就全不算数了。

331
00:25:20,804 --> 00:25:24,888
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_15|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]我的灯要放在哪儿？我跟着人走，就看不见门缝。

332
00:25:24,888 --> 00:25:32,758
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_16|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]灯留下，人拴在旁边那根梁上。火灭了你还有手，敲铁管。

333
00:25:32,758 --> 00:25:35,521
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_17|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]两下，告诉你们我还在？

334
00:25:35,521 --> 00:25:40,501
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_18|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]对。要是听不见，就看我。我会先把你拉回来。

335
00:25:40,501 --> 00:25:44,431
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_19|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Mideng]那你也看我。别只顾下面，忘了自己的索。

336
00:25:44,431 --> 00:25:50,286
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_20|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]木撑裂了，不能再试。我和苇禾守下层，你在上层绕线。

337
00:25:50,286 --> 00:25:58,006
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_21|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Yabo]我去取救索。弥灯的报风台另找一根梁，不能全挤在这里。

338
00:25:58,006 --> 00:26:02,941
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_22|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]门真开了，下面不会等你们绑第二次。

339
00:26:02,941 --> 00:26:08,316
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B50_23|beat=B50|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]所以现在绑。你手里的那根，也找个能松开的地方。

340
00:26:08,316 --> 00:26:20,076
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B50_A23|beat=B50|after=23}

341
00:26:20,076 --> 00:26:23,996
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B27_A00|beat=B27|after=0}

342
00:26:23,996 --> 00:26:31,301
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_01|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]黑索去主轴，黄索去侧闸，红索去报风台。别换着用。

343
00:26:31,301 --> 00:26:34,631
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_02|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]黑索给弥灯。她那边风最大。

344
00:26:34,631 --> 00:26:39,561
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_03|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Mideng]黑索太短，够不到我的梁。我要长一点的红索。

345
00:26:39,561 --> 00:26:42,686
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_04|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Xiaozao]……对，你比我清楚那根梁。

346
00:26:42,686 --> 00:26:46,886
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B27_A04|beat=B27|after=4}

347
00:26:46,886 --> 00:26:51,801
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_05|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]把扣转过来，别顶着肋骨。疼了你就拉不动了。

348
00:26:51,801 --> 00:26:57,066
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_06|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]尾巴留出来。受力以后，死结谁也解不开。

349
00:26:57,066 --> 00:26:59,361
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_07|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Jianwang]这个结受过力，尾巴太短。

350
00:26:59,361 --> 00:27:04,901
@WindwardStore
{Event:Act|id=B27_08|beat=B27|tone=intimate}
[Yabo]那你留长点。拿着另一头，我这两根手指拽不紧。

351
00:27:04,901 --> 00:27:10,781
@WindwardStore
{Event:Action|id=B27_A08|beat=B27|after=8}

352
00:27:10,781 --> 00:27:14,981
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B28_A00|beat=B28|after=0}

353
00:27:14,981 --> 00:27:20,751
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_01|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]还有旧排风口。风从集市出去，风种就能完整取走。

354
00:27:20,751 --> 00:27:25,326
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_02|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]棚子已经倒了。全打开，风铃渡就没有了。

355
00:27:25,326 --> 00:27:28,431
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_03|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]人都在温室。房子可以重建。

356
00:27:28,431 --> 00:27:34,186
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_04|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Weihe]工具、存粮、过冬的火，全在房子里。不是几块空木头。

357
00:27:34,186 --> 00:27:38,686
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B28_A04|beat=B28|after=4}

358
00:27:38,686 --> 00:27:40,826
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_05|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]至少不用五个人同时赌一次。

359
00:27:40,826 --> 00:27:45,676
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_06|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]你不赌，是让他们付。我要开井底的闸。

360
00:27:45,676 --> 00:27:50,746
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_07|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]那就得切断我的主线。切了，风种再也取不出来。

361
00:27:50,746 --> 00:27:56,276
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B28_08|beat=B28|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]所以你要拦我们，不是因为没有路，是因为你不肯空手走。

362
00:27:56,276 --> 00:28:02,576
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B28_A08|beat=B28|after=8}

363
00:28:02,576 --> 00:28:09,296
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B29_A00|beat=B29|after=0}

364
00:28:09,296 --> 00:28:13,136
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_01|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]我会先封住温室的门。人不会伤到，你站开。

365
00:28:13,136 --> 00:28:14,531
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_02|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]她们先过去。

366
00:28:14,531 --> 00:28:16,111
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_03|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你还是想替所有人挡。

367
00:28:16,111 --> 00:28:20,296
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_04|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]不是。她们有自己的事，我只挡你。

368
00:28:20,296 --> 00:28:27,496
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B29_A04|beat=B29|after=4}

369
00:28:27,496 --> 00:28:31,171
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_05|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Weihe]弥灯，走！别回头数他打了几拳！

370
00:28:31,171 --> 00:28:32,066
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_06|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]哈！

371
00:28:32,066 --> 00:28:34,221
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_07|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你的脚，被我看见了。

372
00:28:34,221 --> 00:28:35,306
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B29_08|beat=B29|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]那你的手呢？

373
00:28:35,306 --> 00:28:45,386
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B29_A08|beat=B29|after=8}

374
00:28:45,386 --> 00:28:52,666
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B30_A00|beat=B30|after=0}

375
00:28:52,666 --> 00:28:55,176
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_01|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]缺了一个孔，你就少一个方向。

376
00:28:55,176 --> 00:28:57,861
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_02|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]也多了一个你想钻进去的地方。

377
00:28:57,861 --> 00:28:59,281
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_03|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你拿自己的手做饵？

378
00:28:59,281 --> 00:29:00,751
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_04|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]已经咬住了。

379
00:29:00,751 --> 00:29:08,551
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B30_A04|beat=B30|after=4}

380
00:29:08,551 --> 00:29:10,076
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_05|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你以为我只有一根线？

381
00:29:10,076 --> 00:29:13,041
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_06|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]我也还有右手——喝！

382
00:29:13,041 --> 00:29:16,696
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_07|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]盘要裂了。你再拉，先碎的是它。

383
00:29:16,696 --> 00:29:19,116
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B30_08|beat=B30|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]那就让它碎在该碎的地方！

384
00:29:19,116 --> 00:29:30,036
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B30_A08|beat=B30|after=8}

385
00:29:30,036 --> 00:29:41,236
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B31_A00|beat=B31|after=0}

386
00:29:41,236 --> 00:29:46,536
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_01|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Weihe]我到了。这个短手柄，试的时候还没这么难压。

387
00:29:46,536 --> 00:29:50,956
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_02|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Yabo]下面压力上来了。腰靠住后边那根梁。

388
00:29:50,956 --> 00:29:53,886
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_03|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Weihe]等出去以后，忘记的账一块算！

389
00:29:53,886 --> 00:29:56,586
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_04|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Mideng]我也到了。你能看见灯吗？

390
00:29:56,586 --> 00:29:58,586
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B31_A04|beat=B31|after=4}

391
00:29:58,586 --> 00:30:01,641
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_05|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Weihe]看见灯，看不见你。往左一点。

392
00:30:01,641 --> 00:30:02,891
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_06|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Mideng]现在呢？

393
00:30:02,891 --> 00:30:05,806
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_07|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Weihe]看见了。别把自己藏在灯后面。

394
00:30:05,806 --> 00:30:09,171
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B31_08|beat=B31|tone=danger}
[Mideng]好。我不是只负责点灯的。

395
00:30:09,171 --> 00:30:25,971
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B31_A08|beat=B31|after=8}

396
00:30:25,971 --> 00:30:31,571
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B32_A00|beat=B32|after=0}

397
00:30:31,571 --> 00:30:35,521
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_01|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Mideng]等……别动，刚才是回声。

398
00:30:35,521 --> 00:30:39,151
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_02|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Weihe]我还压着。你慢慢分，不用怕我等。

399
00:30:39,151 --> 00:30:42,896
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_03|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Yabo]肩膀别往前翻，用脚跟顶地！

400
00:30:42,896 --> 00:30:45,721
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_04|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Mideng]来了！现在，压！

401
00:30:45,721 --> 00:30:51,721
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B32_A04|beat=B32|after=4}

402
00:30:51,721 --> 00:30:52,346
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_05|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Weihe]哈——！

403
00:30:52,346 --> 00:30:55,971
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_06|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Yabo]开了一指！留着，别再压！

404
00:30:55,971 --> 00:30:59,591
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_07|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Mideng]不对，它在合上。主轴那边还有线！

405
00:30:59,591 --> 00:31:02,576
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B32_08|beat=B32|tone=danger}
[Weihe]小凿，你得把他那只手带过来！

406
00:31:02,576 --> 00:31:10,976
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B32_A08|beat=B32|after=8}

407
00:31:10,976 --> 00:31:17,136
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B33_A00|beat=B33|after=0}

408
00:31:17,136 --> 00:31:19,621
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_01|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]门口这根线，你过不去。

409
00:31:19,621 --> 00:31:22,531
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_02|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]左腕被你锁住，右边还空着。

410
00:31:22,531 --> 00:31:25,411
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_03|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]够你出拳，不够你过人。

411
00:31:25,411 --> 00:31:27,006
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_04|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]我不出拳。

412
00:31:27,006 --> 00:31:33,606
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B33_A04|beat=B33|after=4}

413
00:31:33,606 --> 00:31:34,511
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_05|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]那就别动。

414
00:31:34,511 --> 00:31:37,376
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_06|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]放着她们在里面，我做不到。

415
00:31:37,376 --> 00:31:39,211
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_07|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]你没有站在那扇门前过。

416
00:31:39,211 --> 00:31:44,926
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B33_08|beat=B33|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]今天站在这里的是我。把线拉紧，你就知道我怎么过。

417
00:31:44,926 --> 00:31:54,166
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B33_A08|beat=B33|after=8}

418
00:31:54,166 --> 00:31:57,526
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B34_A00|beat=B34|after=0}

419
00:31:57,526 --> 00:31:59,121
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_01|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Mideng]我看不见灯芯了。

420
00:31:59,121 --> 00:32:02,021
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_02|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]那就听我。听得见这两下吗？

421
00:32:02,021 --> 00:32:03,386
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_03|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Mideng]听得见。

422
00:32:03,386 --> 00:32:06,506
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_04|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]我还在这边。你也敲两下。

423
00:32:06,506 --> 00:32:10,106
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B34_A04|beat=B34|after=4}

424
00:32:10,106 --> 00:32:11,281
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_05|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Mideng]这样？

425
00:32:11,281 --> 00:32:13,926
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_06|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]对。现在我也知道你在了。

426
00:32:13,926 --> 00:32:17,266
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_07|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Mideng]……风要来了，比刚才更早。

427
00:32:17,266 --> 00:32:19,386
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B34_08|beat=B34|tone=intimate}
[Weihe]这一次，你说了算。

428
00:32:19,386 --> 00:32:24,426
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B34_A08|beat=B34|after=8}

429
00:32:24,426 --> 00:32:29,466
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B35_A00|beat=B35|after=0}

430
00:32:29,466 --> 00:32:30,656
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_01|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你终于不挣了。

431
00:32:30,656 --> 00:32:33,051
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_02|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]再拽下去，谁也走不了。

432
00:32:33,051 --> 00:32:33,921
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_03|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]把盘留下。

433
00:32:33,921 --> 00:32:37,041
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_04|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]甲可以留下。手不行。

434
00:32:37,041 --> 00:32:42,441
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B35_A04|beat=B35|after=4}

435
00:32:42,441 --> 00:32:43,431
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_05|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]你……

436
00:32:43,431 --> 00:32:46,531
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_06|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]弥灯，继续报！我马上到！

437
00:32:46,531 --> 00:32:49,096
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_07|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Jianwang]没有护腕，你接不住下一次！

438
00:32:49,096 --> 00:32:51,711
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Act|id=B35_08|beat=B35|tone=danger}
[Xiaozao]这一次，先让她们出来！

439
00:32:51,711 --> 00:32:59,271
@WindwardCourt
{Event:Action|id=B35_A08|beat=B35|after=8}

440
00:32:59,271 --> 00:33:06,271
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B36_A00|beat=B36|after=0}

441
00:33:06,271 --> 00:33:10,271
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_01|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Xiaozao]脚先回来。左脚踩我这块，不要急着松手。

442
00:33:10,271 --> 00:33:13,196
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_02|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Weihe]你把盘塞进去，它还怎么拿出来？

443
00:33:13,196 --> 00:33:15,286
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_03|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Xiaozao]先把你的脚拿出来。

444
00:33:15,286 --> 00:33:17,036
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_04|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Mideng]下一阵，十息以内！

445
00:33:17,036 --> 00:33:24,536
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B36_A04|beat=B36|after=4}

446
00:33:24,536 --> 00:33:25,971
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_05|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Jianwang]那盘撑不过十息。

447
00:33:25,971 --> 00:33:31,226
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_06|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Xiaozao]所以别看着它。主轴的线在你手里，把它接到那根梁！

448
00:33:31,226 --> 00:33:32,246
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_07|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Jianwang]梁已经裂了。

449
00:33:32,246 --> 00:33:36,821
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B36_08|beat=B36|tone=finale}
[Yabo]右边那根没裂！你总盯着坏的那一根干什么！

450
00:33:36,821 --> 00:33:47,321
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B36_A08|beat=B36|after=8}

451
00:33:47,321 --> 00:33:52,921
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B37_A00|beat=B37|after=0}

452
00:33:52,921 --> 00:33:56,026
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_01|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Jianwang]我只是换一个支点。风种还是我的。

453
00:33:56,026 --> 00:33:58,581
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_02|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Xiaozao]你要争，等这扇门开了再争。

454
00:33:58,581 --> 00:34:02,451
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_03|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Weihe]你们两个，能不能先把嘴腾出来喘气？

455
00:34:02,451 --> 00:34:05,086
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_04|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Mideng]第一阵过去了……第二阵，准备！

456
00:34:05,086 --> 00:34:11,086
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B37_A04|beat=B37|after=4}

457
00:34:11,086 --> 00:34:15,546
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_05|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Yabo]别一齐使劲，小凿先顶，苇禾再压！

458
00:34:15,546 --> 00:34:16,346
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_06|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Xiaozao]顶住了！

459
00:34:16,346 --> 00:34:17,116
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_07|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Weihe]压——！

460
00:34:17,116 --> 00:34:19,991
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B37_08|beat=B37|tone=finale}
[Jianwang]停！你们把我的主线也压进去了！

461
00:34:19,991 --> 00:34:28,391
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B37_A08|beat=B37|after=8}

462
00:34:28,391 --> 00:34:33,431
@WindwardWell
{Event:Action|id=B38_A00|beat=B38|after=0}

463
00:34:33,431 --> 00:34:37,021
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B38_01|beat=B38|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]不是我们压住你，是你另一只手不肯放。

464
00:34:37,021 --> 00:34:40,336
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B38_02|beat=B38|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]放了，风种就会回到井底。

465
00:34:40,336 --> 00:34:42,499
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B38_03|beat=B38|tone=dispute}
[Xiaozao]它本来就在这里。

466
00:34:42,499 --> 00:34:45,574
@WindwardWell
{Event:Act|id=B38_04|beat=B38|tone=dispute}
[Jianwang]我来这里，不是帮你们修桥的！

467
